{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U1JuZZ24TzqN4CpnFDyJ3X","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/paper/sections/method.tex:24:Compared to trajectory-level labeling, windows provide the granularity needed to pinpoint \\emph{when} stagnation begins and ends within a single task attempt, enabling downstream interventions such as early termination or strategy switching."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J9mMQiU1eBCBk3nHY2eCBZ","session_id":"d074e59e-e78e-4d2c-a1a9-c5b03b4aa2ca","uuid":"22ea5df0-5f4f-4d79-814a-46caf07ecf02","timestamp":"2026-05-15T15:31:05.413Z"}
